  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075095/description_080d9090-e63d-4844-822c-6be548f39d3a.gif\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\"> <span style=\"color:#19f599\">Только Молот</span>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075095/description_6a83e075-b9e4-4196-ba1c-c61d83d551b6.gif\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\"></h1>\n<p>Only Hammer добавляет создаваемые полезные молоты, которые представляют собой кирки, добывающие ресурсы в области 3x3. От деревянного молота до незеритового — всё в духе ванильного геймплея, что упрощает спуск в шахты, выравнивание гор или удаление чанков, а также любые другие задачи, которые вы придумаете.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#a74cdc\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075095/description_eb0723c9-ddd4-49b1-9907-c193173ad4a7.gif\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"> <span style=\"color:#10e78e\">Характеристики молотов:</span></span></h2>\n<table style=\"width:99.8747%;border:1px solid rgb(30, 202, 131);margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:33.0402%;border-color:rgb(30, 202, 131);border-width:1px\">\n<h3><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075095/description_f473db31-c36b-420d-880c-10b01b8302de.gif\" width=\"27\" height=\"27\"> <span style=\"color:#14d585\">Молоты</span></h3>\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:9.42211%;border-color:rgb(30, 202, 131);border-width:1px\"><strong>Дерево</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:9.54774%;border-color:rgb(30, 202, 131);border-width:1px\"><strong>Камень</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:10.804%;border-color:rgb(30, 202, 131);border-width:1px\"><strong>Железо</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:10.5528%;border-color:rgb(30, 202, 131);border-width:1px\"><strong>Золото</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:13.5678%;border-color:rgb(30, 202, 131);border-width:1px\"><strong>Алмаз</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:13.0653%;border-color:rgb(30, 202, 131);border-width:1px\"><strong>Незерит</strong></th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:33.0402%;border-color:rgb(30, 202, 131);border-width:1px\"><strong>&nbsp; УРОН В АТАКЕ</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:9.42211%;border-color:rgb(30, 202, 131);border-width:1px\"><strong>2</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:9.54774%;border-color:rgb(30, 202, 131);border-width:1px\"><strong>3</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:10.804%;border-color:rgb(30, 202, 131);border-width:1px\"><strong>4</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:10.5528%;border-color:rgb(30, 202, 131);border-width:1px\"><strong>2</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:13.5678%;border-color:rgb(30, 202, 131);border-width:1px\"><strong>5</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:13.0653%;border-color:rgb(30, 202, 131);border-width:1px\"><strong>6</strong></th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:33.0402%;border-color:rgb(30, 202, 131);border-width:1px\"><strong>&nbsp; ЭФФЕКТИВНОСТЬ</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:9.42211%;border-color:rgb(30, 202, 131);border-width:1px\"><strong>2</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:9.54774%;border-color:rgb(30, 202, 131);border-width:1px\"><strong>4</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:10.804%;border-color:rgb(30, 202, 131);border-width:1px\"><strong>6</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:10.5528%;border-color:rgb(30, 202, 131);border-width:1px\"><strong>10</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:13.5678%;border-color:rgb(30, 202, 131);border-width:1px\"><strong>8</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:13.0653%;border-color:rgb(30, 202, 131);border-width:1px\"><strong>9</strong></th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:33.0402%;border-color:rgb(30, 202, 131);border-width:1px\"><strong>&nbsp; СКОРОСТЬ АТАКИ</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:9.42211%;border-color:rgb(30, 202, 131);border-width:1px\"><strong>1.2</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:9.54774%;border-color:rgb(30, 202, 131);border-width:1px\"><strong>1.2</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:10.804%;border-color:rgb(30, 202, 131);border-width:1px\"><strong>1.2</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:10.5528%;border-color:rgb(30, 202, 131);border-width:1px\"><strong>1.2</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:13.5678%;border-color:rgb(30, 202, 131);border-width:1px\"><strong>1.2</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:13.0653%;border-color:rgb(30, 202, 131);border-width:1px\"><strong>1.2</strong></th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:33.0402%;border-color:rgb(30, 202, 131);border-width:1px\"><strong>&nbsp; ПРОЧНОСТЬ</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:9.42211%;border-color:rgb(30, 202, 131);border-width:1px\"><strong>59</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:9.54774%;border-color:rgb(30, 202, 131);border-width:1px\"><strong>131</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:10.804%;border-color:rgb(30, 202, 131);border-width:1px\"><strong>250</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:10.5528%;border-color:rgb(30, 202, 131);border-width:1px\"><strong>32</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:13.5678%;border-color:rgb(30, 202, 131);border-width:1px\"><strong>1.561</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:13.0653%;border-color:rgb(30, 202, 131);border-width:1px\"><strong>2.032</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075095/description_d1b1c5e1-d633-4eee-a93b-d059258c363c.png\" width=\"357\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075095/description_c0d9708b-085f-4998-8823-ae55624d0b2f.png\" width=\"357\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075095/description_0204d365-48e8-4500-ba01-41b812f40c49.png\" width=\"357\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075095/description_d28d9804-e4a3-44c8-bcf6-60a5e3e988e0.png\" width=\"357\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075095/description_f7938899-2196-487f-9ece-402b88ebad91.png\" width=\"357\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075095/description_463783d9-9fc2-4ce2-9c24-6b46876ca5c7.png\" width=\"357\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075095/description_a9d5fb34-b648-47dc-996a-60e33d49a64f.png\" width=\"503\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075095/description_d074e5e6-0d2d-428e-baef-8f16bae1d348.png\" width=\"802\" height=\"170\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075095/description_73d76bef-8a99-4d7c-88bb-c893827cbf68.png\" width=\"817\" height=\"515\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1075095/description_87fd7ea6-a36f-4c79-937a-5cd9c850080e.png\" width=\"817\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#04bc6f\">Список изменений:</span></h1>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>3.5.0 Исправлены некоторые параметры молотов, исправлены достижения и немного улучшено внутриигровое описание</p>\n<p>3.0.0 Добавлена вкладка «Творчество», испанский язык и слегка изменены текстуры всех молотов</p>\n<p>2.5.0 Небольшие изменения некоторых текстур, добавлено два новых достижения и изменено ещё два</p>\n<p>2.0.0 Добавлены два новых молота: деревянные и каменные</p>\n<p>1.5.0 Добавлены достижения и незначительно изменены текстуры</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#0dc10d\">Мои другие моды:</span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0dc10d\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/only-paxel\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1196993/description_981c06d9-c927-4767-b3b1-de3cdf7e9bff.gif\" width=\"380\" height=\"380\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ruby-above-netherite\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1196993/description_53650165-cfc9-44f9-b627-aa7884176500.gif\" width=\"380\" height=\"380\"></a></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/superior-ores\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073848/description_a19c40e0-c7f0-4efc-8171-3236ec432043.gif\" width=\"379\" height=\"379\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-emerald-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1196993/description_7350f68f-82e7-4ed5-bda5-e3244004698e.png\" width=\"380\" height=\"380\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/only-excavator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1196993/description_842d686c-f50a-47ea-9c18-ac9bc93d5bf8.gif\" width=\"380\" height=\"380\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-copper\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1196993/description_e7f8d29e-6c87-4cec-8f02-2416fe1c191b.png\" width=\"380\" height=\"380\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/only-bags\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1196993/description_70701335-f9ee-471a-a947-f52c825e92ac.gif\" width=\"380\" height=\"380\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-amethyst-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1196993/description_4689dbdb-38c7-4c1d-bc2e-39427e1cf1d0.png\" width=\"379\" height=\"379\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/charcoal-plus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1073844/description_37572d3b-4085-44d5-a4f7-c78d77242cd8.png\" width=\"379\" height=\"379\"></a></p>",
